      "mergedPostDetails": "The scale of the nameplates can be set to:\n\n- Tiny\n\n- Small\n\n- Normal\n\n- Medium\n\n- Large\n\nIt's not actively wrong, but it's unsymmetric and a bit unintuitive.\n\nAlso, the string `Medium` 24455 is shared with the `Medium`'s in Graphic Setting.",
