      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also please note `quality::Medium` will not work here anymore for quality presets, as since this setting name was changed from just \"quality\" to \"quality preset\" it's also changed form of word at least in Russian. So, now we have at least three forms of word:\n\n* Средн**яя** (предустановка качества графики) (preset) (feminine non-plural adjective)\n\n* Средн**ее** (качество теней) (shadows) (neutrum non-plural adjective)\n\n* Средн**ий** (уровень детализации) (LOD) (masculine non-plural adjective)\n\nplus Medium as avatar ranking",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
