  "details": "Source string 24455 \"Medium\" shared across multiple irrelevant places with no shared context.\n\nhttps://crowdin.com/translate/vrchat-application/19/en-ru#24455\n\nThere is no other instances \n\nhttps://crowdin.com/translate/vrchat-application/19/en-ru?filter=basic&value=0#q=Medium\n\nAtleast, what I found:\n\n- \"Medium\" as avatar performance rank\n\n- \"Medium\" as graphics quality selector in Low-Medum-High (multiple instances)\n\n- \"Medium\" as nameplate size selector in Tiny-Small-Normal-Medium-Large\n\nEach instance of \"Medium\" (including all instances in quality settings) must be separated, as in many languages it may have various forms.\n\nFor example, in Russian, at least:\n\n- Medium as rank (not translated)\n\n- Medium as Level (of Detail / LOD) / as Size (of Nameplates) is **Средний** уровень / размер\n\n- Medium as Quality (of Shadows) is **Среднее** качество",
